#
# Media types for Apache (or LiteSpeed), which serves the assembled web shell
# (web/dist) as is. Browsers refuse ES modules served with any other type than
# JavaScript; the licenses and the privacy policy are shown as plain text, all in
# UTF-8.

AddType text/javascript .js .mjs
AddType text/plain .md
AddDefaultCharset utf-8
<Files "LICENSE">
  ForceType text/plain
</Files>

# The web shell stays public even when a parent folder asks for a password.
Satisfy Any
Require all granted
